+       entry .namedTuples   `-language:experimental.namedTuples`, w wersjach 3.5 i 3.6
+       entry .genericNumberLiterals   `-language:experimental.genericNumberLiterals`, w każdej wersji
+       entry .betterMatchTypeExtractors   `-language:experimental.betterMatchTypeExtractors`, w wersjach 3.5 i 3.6
+       entry .quotedPatternsWithPolymorphicFunctions   `-language:experimental.quotedPatternsWithPolymorphicFunctions`, w wersji 3.6
+       entry .betterFors   `-language:experimental.betterFors`, w wersji 3.6

